      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "⭕面试公司：字节跳动\n⭕面试岗位：后台开发\n⭕面试问题：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d16324000000002902fcaa.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "602780ae7830a647a6b22d2ee36456a746dbc6257dba66f735fb71e43d99da46",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d16324000000002902fcaa.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "4afe528f4f7f3ad950f1fb5a53881e1847f98c42dc84024794f9b27e9a14fcec",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d16324000000002902fcaa:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "1. 没有自我介绍，一上来面试官直接说，你是有实习经历的是吧（我简历上压根没实习...）。我说我没有实习经历，但是有解决实际需求的项目经历，于是打算把rag项目跟他说说。结果对方直接打断然后来一句“我们这是后台开发，你跟我讲大模型有啥用”然后指名道姓要我讲另一个java项目",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d16324000000002902fcaa.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "602780ae7830a647a6b22d2ee36456a746dbc6257dba66f735fb71e43d99da46",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d16324000000002902fcaa.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "4afe528f4f7f3ad950f1fb5a53881e1847f98c42dc84024794f9b27e9a14fcec",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d16324000000002902fcaa:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2. 简单介绍了下java项目，他要我说es的底层架构。我先讲了讲倒排索引，不满意；又说了说索引库、文档，还是不满意。硬是要我描述es底层是什么架构（这又不是常见面试题我两个月速成的哪有时间准备这玩意啊）最后只能道歉",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d16324000000002902fcaa.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "602780ae7830a647a6b22d2ee36456a746dbc6257dba66f735fb71e43d99da46",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d16324000000002902fcaa.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "4afe528f4f7f3ad950f1fb5a53881e1847f98c42dc84024794f9b27e9a14fcec",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d16324000000002902fcaa:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "3. 从这里开始我就感到不对劲了，因为这个面试官不仅会频繁打断我说话，而且只听自己想听的，完全不给我回避问题的机会。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d16324000000002902fcaa.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
